            "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PVP SRPG</h2>This unique PVP game makes you experience the charm of SRPG that you never meet before. With classic turn-basic mechanism, every move is worth consideration.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Map</h2>Maps are make up of hexagon terrains. Forest that let you dodge physic attack, Wind Rest Array that makes you move again, and Alchemy Array that can draw a card, all these different terrains are the key to succeed.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hero</h2>There are tons of combination with heroes. Each hero, each skill can have reaction with others. Are you ready? Pick your hero and join a wonderful battle.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment</h2>There three types of equipment: weapon, armor and accessory. At the beginning, players can get equipment with useful functionality. And you can get even more when you promote your progress.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magical Card</h2>Magical card is the most use card except skill. There are over 30 types of magical card. Although your good fortune may not a decisive factor, a magical card can sometimes change your situation.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2>There are various modes in the game, Except the conventional 1V1 mode, we had prepared 3V3 mode. Call your friends and play together!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Mode</h2>Well-designed story mode levels, helps you learn the game better, and lead you to the myth of Dragon Wing continent.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PVP SRPG</h2>This unique PVP game makes you experience the charm of SRPG that you never meet before. With classic turn-basic mechanism, every move is worth consideration.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Map</h2>Maps are make up of hexagon terrains. Forest that let you dodge physic attack, Wind Rest Array that makes you move again, and Alchemy Array that can draw a card, all these different terrains are the key to succeed.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hero</h2>There are tons of combination with heroes. Each hero, each skill can have reaction with others. Are you ready? Pick your hero and join a wonderful battle.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equipment</h2>There three types of equipment: weapon, armor and accessory. At the beginning, players can get equipment with useful functionality. And you can get even more when you promote your progress.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Magical Card</h2>Magical card is the most use card except skill. There are over 30 types of magical card. Although your good fortune may not a decisive factor, a magical card can sometimes change your situation.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2>There are various modes in the game, Except the conventional 1V1 mode, we had prepared 3V3 mode. Call your friends and play together!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Mode</h2>Well-designed story mode levels, helps you learn the game better, and lead you to the myth of Dragon Wing continent.</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "This is a world in which sword and magic rule, an era of heroes that time will not forget, and a place where glorious victory in battle immortalizes you throughout time, and you are the author. Dragon Wing is for you to write, and write you will! Go, hero! Make it a magnificent and epic chapter!",
            "supported_languages": "Chinês simplificado<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
